    { "VLESS, Reality, Trojan, Shadowsocks, SOCKS and AmneziaWG for the whole Mac. A fork of senko (GPL-2.0); the network core comes from it, the rest is new. OpenSSL, libssh2, ZBar and cJSON inside. Menu bar icon by Glyphish (glyphish.com), CC BY 3.0.", "VLESS, Reality, Trojan, Shadowsocks, SOCKS и AmneziaWG для всего Mac. Форк senko (GPL-2.0): сетевое ядро взято оттуда, остальное написано заново. Внутри — OpenSSL, libssh2, ZBar и cJSON. Значок в строке меню — Glyphish (glyphish.com), CC BY 3.0.", "为整台 Mac 提供 VLESS、Reality、Trojan、Shadowsocks、SOCKS 和 AmneziaWG。基于 senko（GPL-2.0）的分支：网络核心来自 senko，其余均为新写。内含 OpenSSL、libssh2、ZBar 和 cJSON。菜单栏图标来自 Glyphish（glyphish.com），CC BY 3.0。" },
